# USE WHEN visualizing knowledge relationships, understanding domain connections, or navigating knowledge structure

# Knowledge Domain Map

## Overview

This map provides a visual representation of the knowledge domains in the 1000xbrain cognitive architecture and their relationships. It serves as a navigation aid for understanding how different knowledge areas connect and complement each other.

